@startuml
title Fig 1.4: SaigonBite OFDH End-to-End Business Process (Swim-lane Activity Diagram)
footer Author: Nguyen Phan Anh Tuan (524H0135)

|Customer (Local / Tourist)|
start
:Log in & select Delivery Address or Hotel (UC1);
:Browse Virtual Brands & in-stock Hub Menu within 7.0 km (UC2);
:Add dishes to cart & request Checkout (UC3);

|OFDH System|
:Check selected Hub active orders (Placed/Confirmed/Preparing);
if (activeOrders >= 25? [Busy-Kitchen Rule]) then (Yes)
  :Block overloaded Hub & find nearby Hub < 50% load;
  |Customer (Local / Tourist)|
  if (Accept nearby Hub with 5% Quiet-Kitchen discount?) then (Yes)
    |OFDH System|
    :Re-route order to suggested Hub & apply 5% discount;
  else (No)
    :Cancel checkout;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Assign order to selected Hub;
endif

:Calculate distance fee (<= 7.0 km) & validate max 1 Voucher;
|Customer (Local / Tourist)|
:Select Payment Method (COD / Domestic E-Wallet / Int'l Card);
|OFDH System|
:Validate payment (Tourist COD <= 500,000 VND);
:Create Order [Placed] & send digital ticket to Hub;

|Hub Kitchen Staff|
:Receive incoming order ticket (UC7);
if (Ingredients available & Kitchen accepts?) then (Yes)
  :Confirm [Confirmed] -> Cook [Preparing] -> Mark [ReadyForPickup] (UC8);
else (No - Stock-out)
  :Toggle item Out-of-Stock (UC9) & Reject order [Rejected];
  |OFDH System|
  :Trigger refund if pre-paid & notify Customer;
  stop
endif

|Shipper|
:Accept DeliveryTask & pick up order -> [OutForDelivery] (UC10);
if (Delivery successful?) then (Yes)
  :Hand over meal & collect COD cash (if COD);
  :Mark [Delivered] & issue digital receipt;
  :Reconcile & hand over COD cash at shift end (UC10);
else (No)
  :Log [DeliveryFailed] with mandatory reason & photo proof;
endif

|Customer (Local / Tourist)|
if (Satisfied with order?) then (Yes)
  :Submit Order Rating & Review within 24h (UC11);
else (No - Late/Wrong item)
  :Submit Complaint & Refund Request within 24h (UC12);
  |Manager / Office Staff|
  :Review evidence & approve/reject Refund -> [Refunded] (UC12);
endif

|Manager / Office Staff|
:Generate Sales, Hub Workload & Delivery Performance Reports (UC16);
stop
@enduml